From: BRL-CAD developers <devs@brlcad.org>
Subject: [PATCH] Build both shared and static manifold; self-contain Clipper2 in the static archive

Three changes to the bext manifold build:

1. Add -DMANIFOLD_BUILD_STATIC_LIBS=ON so bext produces both
   libmanifold.so and libmanifold.a alongside the existing shared library.
   This allows BRL-CAD's static library targets (BRLCAD::rt-static, etc.)
   to link manifold::manifold-static instead of falling back to the shared
   library, removing the runtime libmanifold.so dependency for consumers
   that link BRL-CAD statically.

   Requires the companion manifold_static_lib.patch to be applied to the
   manifold upstream first.

2. Switch to MANIFOLD_USE_BUILTIN_CLIPPER2=ON with
   FETCHCONTENT_SOURCE_DIR_CLIPPER2 pointing at bext's own Clipper2 source
   tree.  This makes manifold build its own internal static Clipper2 via
   FetchContent (manifoldDeps.cmake already forces BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=OFF
   before the fetch), which the static manifold target then absorbs via
   $<TARGET_OBJECTS:Clipper2>.  The result is a fully self-contained
   libmanifold.a with no Clipper2 runtime dependency.

   Using FETCHCONTENT_SOURCE_DIR_CLIPPER2 with MANIFOLD_DOWNLOADS=OFF is
   explicitly supported by manifoldDeps.cmake: logmissingdep() returns
   early (no error) when FETCHCONTENT_SOURCE_DIR_Clipper2 is defined,
   regardless of MANIFOLD_DOWNLOADS.

   The Clipper2_ROOT pass-through is removed because the external
   installed Clipper2 is no longer used by this build.

   Note: the bext-installed libClipper2.so is still built and installed by
   the separate CLIPPER2_BLD ExternalProject for any consumers that want
   to use Clipper2 directly.

3. Drop -DMANIFOLD_DEBUG=ON.  Enabling debug tracing in a library
   installed as part of BRL-CAD leaks verbose timing output to end-user
   applications and results in extra debug symbols in the installed library.

Applies to: BRL-CAD/bext, main branch (manifold/CMakeLists.txt)
--- a/manifold/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/manifold/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -19,7 +19,9 @@ if (ENABLE_MANIFOLD)
     CMAKE_ARGS
     ${BUILD_TYPE_SPECIFIER}
-    $<$<BOOL:${CLIPPER2_TARGET}>:-DClipper2_ROOT=${CMAKE_BUNDLE_INSTALL_PREFIX}>
-    -DMANIFOLD_CBIND=OFF
-    -DMANIFOLD_DEBUG=ON
-    -DMANIFOLD_DOWNLOADS=OFF
-    -DMANIFOLD_EXPORT=OFF
-    -DMANIFOLD_JSBIND=OFF
-    -DMANIFOLD_OPTIMIZED=ON
-    -DMANIFOLD_PAR=OFF
-    -DMANIFOLD_STRICT=OFF
-    -DMANIFOLD_TEST=OFF
+    -DMANIFOLD_BUILD_STATIC_LIBS=ON
+    -DMANIFOLD_CBIND=OFF
+    -DMANIFOLD_CROSS_SECTION=ON
+    -DMANIFOLD_DEBUG=OFF
+    -DMANIFOLD_DOWNLOADS=OFF
+    -DMANIFOLD_EXPORT=OFF
+    -DMANIFOLD_JSBIND=OFF
+    -DMANIFOLD_OPTIMIZED=ON
+    -DMANIFOLD_PAR=OFF
+    -DMANIFOLD_STRICT=OFF
+    -DMANIFOLD_TEST=OFF
+    -DMANIFOLD_USE_BUILTIN_CLIPPER2=ON
+    -DFETCHCONTENT_SOURCE_DIR_CLIPPER2=${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/../clipper2/Clipper2/CPP
     -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=${CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER}
